</div><div class="d2m-grid three">{% for product in bottoms.products limit:3 %}<a class="d2m-card" href="{{ product.url }}">{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: product.title }}<h3>{{ product.title }}</h3><div class="price">{{ product.price | money }}</div></a>{% endfor %}</div></section><section id="looks" class="d2m-section"><div class="d2m-section-head"><h2>LOOKS</h2><span class="d2m-view">CURATED OUTFITS</span></div><div class="d2m-looks"><a class="d2m-look" href="/collections/logo-essentials"><strong>LOOK 01</strong><p>D2M ESSENTIALS TEE<br>+ STATIC WIDE-LEG PANTS<br><b>€119</b></p></a><a class="d2m-look" href="/products/split-figures-zip"><strong>LOOK 02</strong><p>SPLIT FIGURES ZIP<br>+ VOID WIDE-LEG JOGGERS<br><b>€179</b></p></a><a class="d2m-look" href="/collections/logo-essentials"><strong>LOOK 03</strong><p>D2M HOODIE<br>+ NO SIGNAL TRACK PANTS<br><b>€158</b></p></a></div></section></div><div class="d2m-benefits"><div class="d2m-benefit"><b>LIMITED DROP</b>Once it's gone, it's gone.</div><div class="d2m-benefit"><b>NO RESTOCKS</b>1 of 1. No second chance.</div><div class="d2m-benefit"><b>WORLDWIDE SHIPPING</b>We ship everywhere.</div><div class="d2m-benefit"><b>SECURE CHECKOUT</b>100% secure payments.</div></div></main><footer class="d2m-footer"><div><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0981/1990/9704/files/d2m-primary-logo.png?v=1788020200" alt="D2M"><p>Clothing for the dead inside.<br>Designed in France.<br>1 of 1. No restocks.</p></div><div class="d2m-news"><b>SUB 2 KNOW WHEN IT DROPS.</b><p><input type="email" placeholder="Email address"><button>SUBMIT</button></p></div><div class="d2m-links"><div><b>SHOP</b><p><a href="/collections/logo-essentials">Logo Essentials</a><br><a href="/collections/graphic-pieces">Graphic Pieces</a><br><a href="/collections/bottoms">Bottoms</a></p></div><div><b>INFO</b><p><a href="/pages/about">About</a><br><a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a><br><a href="/pages/returns">Returns</a></p></div></div></footer></div>{% schema %}{"name":"D2M Home","settings":[],"presets":[{"name":"D2M Home"}]}{% endschema %}